 1951 to 2025, and June to July came in under 90% of normal in 44 of those years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 198% of normal in July to August and only 29% in November to December. So far in 2026, June to July came in at 244% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 11825 had its driest year in 1954 at 37% of normal.</p>"}
